ate]} {:db/id "q-343341/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "6e9f62db-2bb7-546c-ac2a-2cb5e29fb689" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-343341/field-3/92201681c24d6a7046bbdb22c3390f0837dad9cfc07eb281e7c448994ec13203" :answer-field/choices ["q-343341/field-3/92201681c24d6a7046bbdb22c3390f0837dad9cfc07eb281e7c448994ec13203" "q-343341/field-3/80411f0f004a7c9cffc87bf03021dc5090bcf0803c94b175de89e4f53a1b33d2" "q-343341/field-3/7bdb29fd3a8262cde8037ab22634195a9f88c03efc6ba00c7a834cdf7ca94006" "q-343341/field-3/34cf9b610f45b0a4a1d03716dd618811fd9e9dfd3df9b5a59403905bfc0cccef"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-343341/field-4/1b97b39dae1fa3ed37d0a5c194c628a501a9fd50a54f7616746ec7da83e7d6e9" :answer/id #uuid "28e225d8-5be8-5c34-b85d-100671d49997" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{5}))" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343341/field-4/15ac0f5aa15d807d2f3d0f3f9a0a2407a5be08159fc4056c6a1c213ca1e53a5a" :answer/id #uuid "5e26c429-b018-5172-ba04-a0919bbec404" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{5})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343341/field-4/cb298701b89b2c569b053d2de48af96e2280baca2ac1fd4d7b220918586f7a06" :answer/id #uuid "27ec4921-580a-555a-9be1-390600192a0d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(1-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{5}))" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343341/field-4/ade30588369467ed17c4af61ad49608bfa1a3009c7f9e8c9242bd289cac31ad6" :answer/id #uuid "e06a8312-c731-55de-9845-9aa33bba5898" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{5})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343341/field-4" :answer-field/id #uuid "c84db665-a52b-55d4-bb57-bb3076f2ce3c" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-343341/field-4/1b97b39dae1fa3ed37d0a5c194c628a501a9fd50a54f7616746ec7da83e7d6e9" :answer-field/choices ["q-343341/field-4/1b97b39dae1fa3ed37d0a5c194c628a501a9fd50a54f7616746ec7da83e7d6e9" "q-343341/field-4/15ac0f5aa15d807d2f3d0f3f9a0a2407a5be08159fc4056c6a1c213ca1e53a5a" "q-343341/field-4/cb298701b89b2c569b053d2de48af96e2280baca2ac1fd4d7b220918586f7a06" "q-343341/field-4/ade30588369467ed17c4af61ad49608bfa1a3009c7f9e8c9242bd289cac31ad6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-343341" :question/id #uuid "de25ec60-135e-5b0f-93ec-2a89a92381de" :question/math-academy-id "q-343341" :question/problem "Let $f(x)$ be the $10$-periodic extension of the function $F(x)=5x$ defined on $[-5,5).$ Select the correct options in the reasoning below, showing the derivation of a series converging to the $10$-periodic extension of \n\n$$\nG(x)=\\frac{5}{2}{x}^{2}={\\int }_{0}^{x}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nfrom the corresponding Fourier series of $f(x).$The Fourier series of $f(x)$ is given by\n\n$$\n5x∼{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{50(-1)^{n+1}}{n\\pi }{{field-1}}.\n$$\n\nSince $f$ is \n{{field-2}} \non $R,$ we may integrate its Fourier series term-by-term to get\n\n$$\n\\frac{5}{2}{x}^{2}∼{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{{field-3}}\\cdot {{field-4}}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that $F(x)$ is an odd function. So, the Fourier series of its $2L$-periodic extension has the form\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{L}).\n$$\n\nIn our case, $L=5$ and we are already given the coefficients ${b}_{n}$ for $n\\ge 1.$ Thus, the Fourier series of $f(x)$ is given by\n\n$$\nf(x)∼{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{50(-1)^{n+1}}{n\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{5}).\n$$\n\nNow, notice that the function $F$ is continuous on $(-5,5).$ \nTherefore, the $10$-periodic extension $f$ is $\\text{piecewise continuous}$ on $R,$ so we may integrate its Fourier series term-by-term:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{x}5t\\,\\text{d}t & ∼{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{\\int }_{0}^{x}\\frac{50(-1)^{n+1}}{n\\pi }\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi t}{5})\\,\\text{d}t \\\\ {[\\frac{5}{2}{t}^{2}]}_{0}^{x} & ∼{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{50(-1)^{n+1}}{n\\pi }\\cdot [-\\frac{5}{n\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi t}{5})]_{0}^{x} \\\\ \\frac{5}{2}{x}^{2} & ∼{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\,\\frac{250(-1)^{n+1}}{{n}^{2}{\\pi }^{2}}\\cdot (1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{5}))\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-343341/field-1" "q-343341/field-2" "q-343341/field-3" "q-343341/field-4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c1e01d04-6c13-52eb-a4b6-ad9a5cde8134"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-343341"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-343340/field-1/5f421b1b632bf1fc680d58f78c52562aa4000324841975d21eeb7a09b51b1180" :answer/id #uuid "2e055695-ba7b-5f6e-9466-c799b360239f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{4})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343340/field-1/47c7c76e47e91f5f3007448603bcf7e8b08f4874b447c92686d925cac328bc48" :answer/id #uuid "28e0cae2-bed9-59d6-ab30-4f56e031b5bc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{4})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343340/field-1/1c6f0ff0651cfc6b884692e40824a99cdec7a5ba2ec99570ae41f93fb1114a6d" :answer/id #uuid "a7108327-ce2f-56d8-a2b7-fc6c4943ed62" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{8})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343340/field-1/b1b52f53825d17e67c988a721996ae84a7a101341dad84f5b4b0e5b97d26a48b" :answer/id #uuid "c22fb743-3cb8-5462-9845-912b168418c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{8})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343340/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "2f8ff5d7-4d52-5de4-aaf4-2ae167c342ac" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-343340/field-1/5f421b1